    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/scholarsgate/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The ScholarsGate theme is a modern, professional, and fully responsive education-focused solution designed for schools, universities, colleges, academic institutions, online learning platforms, e-learning portals, coaching centers, training academies, distance education programs, virtual classrooms, and tutoring services seeking a polished and dynamic online presence. Ideal for showcasing academic courses, degree programs, lesson plans, educational events, workshops, webinars, and faculty profiles, this theme provides everything needed to create a feature-rich learning environment. Integrated with the LearnPress plugin, it supports course creation, online quizzes, student progress tracking, enrollment management, and certification systems. With its clean, customizable layout, event calendar integration, student testimonials, and advanced course filtering options, ScholarsGate offers an engaging and intuitive experience for students, teachers, and administrators. SEO-friendly architecture, optimized performance, and fast loading speed improve visibility and accessibility, while the retina-ready and mobile-optimized design ensures seamless functionality across all devices. Perfect for education portals, LMS websites, coaching institutes, and online academies, the ScholarsGate theme empowers institutions to build a professional, interactive, and future-ready educational platform for modern learners."
    },
